  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<span style='text-indent:0px; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; display:inline !important;'>\n\n<div>The data layer identifies areas of disturbance to vegetation including burns, commercial forestry harvesting (cuts), weather events, infrastructure and pest/disease.</div>\n\n<div><br /> </div>\n\n<div><strong>Additional Documentation </strong></div>\n\n<div><ul>\n\n<li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Provincial_Satellite_Derived_Disturbance_Mapping-FarNorth.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Provincial Satellite Derived Disturbance Mapping - Data Specification Report (PDF)</a><br /></li>\n\n</ul></div>\n\n\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Status</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>On going: Data is continually being updated<br /></div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>As needed: Data is updated as deemed necessary<br /></div>\n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Contact</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>Ian Smyth, Science and Research Branch, <a href='mailto:ian.smyth@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>ian.smyth@ontario.ca</a></div></span>"
